[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0010","text":"──五、六、七、八！\n嗒嗒，定格……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0020","text":"哈啊……刚、刚才……\n已、已经挺像样的了吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0030","text":"……不是挺好的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0040","text":"真，真的吗……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0050","text":"好厉害啊\n小糸"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0060","text":"谢谢你们陪我练，两个人\n下次练习的时候让训练师老师看看吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0070","text":"对了，今天\n要不要来我家吃？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0080","text":"啊……不、不用了！　我就在这里……\n还有点事要做……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0090","text":"小糸好像很忙"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0100","text":"练习时间也增加了\n自主练习也在做"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0110","text":"……樋口呢？\n咖喱和拉西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0120","text":"……走吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0130","text":"咦～\n你们俩现在回去～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0140","text":"啊，雏菜\n你在家吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0150","text":"嗯～\n今天回去～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0160","text":"这样啊\n那拜拜～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0170","text":"拜拜～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0180","text":"──哇，这是什么\n雏菜，东西乱扔不收"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0190","text":"……？\n这个笔记本，不是雏菜的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_05_0200","text":"诶\n啊─，这个……"}]
